                        "review": "Its fun gameplay and almost no lag but theres just one problem:the lack of players playing at all times. i bought this just today and joined multiple times. maybe its just because its in the midle of the week and ill surely play this again soon, but its just not as fun shooting bots, mainly because you dont get kills for shooting them and theres no bot only mode where they get you something other than 5hp. But that set aside, i really enjoyed it and i hope this gets a bigger playerbase so that erveryone can find a server when they want to. Its a cool concept and good execution with just a lack of people but that cant be fixed by the devs.",
